15/438 | woodlots | The trees of the copse not cut by the 69th were small trees | - | 1863-07-03 | stated | The study quotes Henry Russell of the 72nd Pennsylvania on the trees not cut down by the 69th for its position along the fence: small trees they were at that time | Of those trees not cut down by the 69th >>> Small trees they were at that time.
